# CR 608.2b: Bot2 Bolts its own Ornithopter in response to the Spellbomb's ability. The target is gone when it resolves, so Bot2's life is unaffected (no redirection) and the Spellbomb is already sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Pyrite Spellbomb
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x17

[Actions]
